	(text "1 CAN bus -> 2 CAN Busses\nSPI Connected to 2 can controllers\nhttps://ww1.microchip.com/downloads/en/DeviceDoc/MCP2515-Stand-Alone-CAN-Controller-with-SPI-20001801J.pdf\nperipheral boards being replaced with CAN (Except power and ground)\nMake a list of sensors that need to be powered by PDB\nReach out to AUTO companies for flow sensor(s)\nUpdate connector to have power(and gnd), can x2, power to peripherals (and gnd), direct inputs.\nDirect inputs go to multiplexer."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
